  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Wu Du Xiu’s funeral stretch, a Wu clan Gu Immortal presses for a formal check of Wu Yi Hai’s identity. That speaker is Wu clan’s third supreme elder, Wu Qiao. Fang Yuan and Qiao clan’s first supreme elder share a look: Qiao clan has reached as high as this third supreme elder inside Wu clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1219
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_du_xiu",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_wu_yi_hai",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_qiao_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Qiao hosts the heritage acknowledgement. He presents an impartial front while multiple gazes land on him as third supreme elder. He stands before Fang Yuan with the rank seven blood path Immortal Gu Bloodline, taken when Wu clan killed a blood path demonic immortal, and uses it to certify second young master’s blood. After many questions he has Fang Yuan refine life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu for Wu clan’s ancestral hall as the mark of acknowledgement into the clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1220
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heritage-ceremony",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_bloodline_immortal_gu",
        "gu_soul_lantern_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Wu Ba Chong moves toward the first seat while Wu Yong’s fate is unclear, Wu Qiao blocks him in the hall. He argues that bloodline still points to Wu Yi Hai as the most qualified heir, not a Central Continent style succession by the second supreme elder. Other Gu Immortals back Wu Ba Chong and remind Wu Qiao he is a Wu clansman, not a Qiao clansman. The text names him the former Wu clan third supreme elder already bribed by Qiao clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1343
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hall-politics",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_ba_chong",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Qiao is the Wu clan Gu Immortal charged with guarding Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian. Loss of that resource point is a heavy stain on him. In that stretch he is solemn, cold, and hesitant to speak for Fang Yuan while his own position is unsafe.",
      "chapters": [
        1345
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-emperor-post",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan says Wu Qiao will bring an Immortal Gu House to escort the party back.",
      "chapters": [
        1346
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-house-escort",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong sits with Mountain Moving Old Monster on one side and Wu clan’s rank seven Gu Immortal Wu Qiao on the other. After Wu Qiao supported Fang Yuan as Wu Yi Hai and then lost Corpse Emperor Yu Ding Tian, Wu Yong suppressed him, stripped the third elder post, and left his status declining day by day. Under Wu Yong’s gaze he sweats, bows, and pledges full support for Wu Yong’s Gu Immortal seed plan, then leaves with deep respect.",
      "chapters": [
        2132
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mountain_moving_old_monster"
      ]
    }
  ],
